# Generated attribution. It belongs in the artifact, never in tracked source: the entries
# it is built from are in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/, and a committed copy is a second answer
# that starts drifting the day it lands (distribution.md §9).
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt

# A repo-local copy of the pinned toolchain, for an agent that wants `zig` on a
# predictable path. The canonical install is ~/.local/zig/<version>/ (ADR-0014);
# this is a convenience and must never enter the history — it is ~400 MB.
.toolchain/

